{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Outlet"},{"type":"text","value":" component is a component that can be used to render the next child route of a parent route."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"outlet-props","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Outlet props"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Outlet"},{"type":"text","value":" component does not accept any props."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"outlet-returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Outlet returns"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If matched, the child route match's "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"component"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"errorComponent"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"pendingComponent"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"notFoundComponent"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If not matched, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"null"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"outlet-props","text":"Outlet props","level":2},{"id":"outlet-returns","text":"Outlet returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `Outlet` component is a component that can be used to render the next child route of a parent route.\n\n## Outlet props\n\nThe `Outlet` component does not accept any props.\n\n## Outlet returns\n\n- If matched, the child route match's `component`/`errorComponent`/`pendingComponent`/`notFoundComponent`.\n- If not matched, `null`.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: outletComponent\ntitle: Outlet component\n---\n\nThe `Outlet` component is a component that can be used to render the next child route of a parent route.\n\n## Outlet props\n\nThe `Outlet` component does not accept any props.\n\n## Outlet returns\n\n- If matched, the child route match's `component`/`errorComponent`/`pendingComponent`/`notFoundComponent`.\n- If not matched, `null`.\n"}
